                "text": "Layer: STRUCTURE | Endospecture: Endosphere + Outer Lens | Omnipere: Noemagraph (in Perifield) | Constellare: Axis (in Perifield) | Refracture: Outer Lens | Exospecture: Exospheres + Threshold",
                "status": "revised",
                "spineRole": "definition",
