                "text": "Layer: CORE QUESTION | Endospecture: \"How do I define my identity?\" | Omnipere: \"Where can thought go?\" | Constellare: \"So what?\" | Refracture: \"How does my identity define me?\" | Exospecture: \"What do I do with my thoughts in the world?\"",
                "status": "revised",
                "spineRole": "definition",
