                    "text": "Example: \"When she koino(reflected) on fairness, she wasn't examining her own concept of fairness (endo) or another's (exo), but the emergent shared understanding of fairness that exists in the averaged space between noemascapes—the fairness-as-communicated, fairness-as-mutually-constructed.\"",
