                "id": "od-part-6-notes-for-future-terminology-work-p57",
                "text": "5. Outer Lens / Threshold terminology — These terms may require further refinement. The key insight to preserve: there are two distinct transitions: (1) cognitive → metacognitive (Endosphere → Perifield, via Outer Lens), and (2) noema → noemata (Noemascape → Exofield, via Threshold). These are different processes at different boundaries.",
